==Unlocking==
This Mount ''cannot'' be obtained through [[Items#Crafting|Item Crafting]].

It is unlocked by performing [[Experiments]], and progress is only counted when the Mount slot is unlocked ([[Paragon]] 26 or 1e380 [[Mysteries]]).

The amount of progress each Experiment contributes varies based on the type (aka color) and amount of [[Crafting Dust]] spent. Progress is determined as follows:
<pre>
({Red dust spent} * 2 + {Blue dust spent} * 1.5 + {Green dust spent} + {Orange dust spent}) / 2e5

Unlocks when quotient is greater than or equal to 1
</pre>

